<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:33:54Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>中朝新鴨綠江大橋通車：北京、平壤與莫斯科的新格局</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:33:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T11:39:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad--010dc4677c88.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">連接中國丹東與朝鮮新義州的新鴨綠江大橋建成12年後正式通車。大橋此前遭長期閒置，被觀察人士視為中朝關係起伏的一個象徵。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國和印度不算老友，尼泊爾想團結他們應對氣候威脅</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674pq1e0dxqo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:33:48Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T05:50:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674pq1e0dxqo/trad--c4314e8bb4de.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c674pq1e0dxqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">尼泊爾能否促成這兩個區域大國攜手應對喜馬拉雅山脈共同面臨的氣候威脅？</summary></entry><entry><title>令人窒息的有毒霧霾蔓延東南亞，誰之過？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T00:20:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad--574ceaf17d79.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">對被指控在印尼焚燒土地的企業，以及未能阻止這些行為的當局，人們的憤怒情緒正不斷升高。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉2026：贏會贏在哪裏，輸會輸在哪裏？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T00:20:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad--14c6dc46283f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC深入分析將界定特朗普總統任期最後兩年的選舉前景，包括關鍵民調、選戰以及議題。</summary></entry><entry><title>減肥針「微劑量」用藥漸成風潮：注射少量真的安全嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:33:51Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T06:09:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad--7673e2d42b97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些人正以小劑量方式使用「胰妥讚」、「週纖達」等GLP-1類藥物。使用者表示，這種方法既能幫助減重，又能減少副作用和節省開支。不過，專家指出，目前幾乎沒研究證據支持這種做法，而且可能存在危險。</summary></entry><entry><title>康奈爾大學因性侵案禁止兄弟會派對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwdd82zm6ml1o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T04:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwdd82zm6ml1o/trad--35b2bbafa145.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwdd82zm6ml1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">學校因處理一名匿名女性提出的性侵指控的方式而面臨強烈輿論反彈。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣選舉解讀：「北藍南綠」的政治版圖是否「鐵板一塊」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T03:36:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad--e4c721debfd7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「北藍南綠」是描述台灣政治版圖的常見概念，但近年選舉結果顯示，這樣的區域分野並非一成不變，中間選民的流向在這次地方選舉可能左右大局。</summary></entry><entry><title>教宗良十四世證實患癌再掀健康透明度擔憂</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kdvn2724po/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T00:20:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kdvn2724po/trad--24e82b1a85b1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kdvn2724po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">由於目前細節仍然不多，因此尚不清楚這位一直著重穩定性的教宗需要作出哪些改變。</summary></entry><entry><title>從今以後，不擇手段？普京新策略要讓烏克蘭全國片瓦無存</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T09:09:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad--f930cb1fb79d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從學校、醫院、酒店、數據中心、火車到橋樑，俄羅斯近數星期加強以導彈和無人機襲擊烏克蘭首都及其他主要城市，攻擊民用目標。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我會跟電視說話」：中國這些孤獨的人付錢感受溫暖</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmqln6xl303no/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T08:42:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmqln6xl303no/trad--1a5d60068ad9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmqln6xl303no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨著中國孤獨感的加劇，一個提供陪伴和支持的新興產業正在興起。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄羅斯以間諜罪嫌抓捕日本駐庫頁島記者</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx054n50gm37o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T10:34:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx054n50gm37o/trad--8d3838a9239b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx054n50gm37o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">莫斯科國安部門指控該名《北海道新聞》記者為東京當局搜集俄國防衛能力情報。</summary></entry><entry><title>中共中央紀委：薄熙來前搭檔黃奇帆接受調查</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r584g9xwpo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T13:34:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r584g9xwpo/trad--9b407cfe729a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r584g9xwpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃奇帆擔任重慶市長期間，上級薄熙來與同僚王立軍系列醜聞爆發。離任後，他仍以經濟學家身分周遊演說。</summary></entry><entry><title>AI翻譯：還有多久會完全取代人類？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg9n72v9p2o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T02:38:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg9n72v9p2o/trad--de11ca890e71.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg9n72v9p2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">人工智能已主導翻譯行業，但高風險的範疇仍然需要人類，例如法律、醫療等領域。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣AV盛極而衰：中國市場如何催生這場成人片熱潮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T09:37:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad--38da8fdcbc19.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣曾被視為亞洲唯一能合法拍攝無碼成人影片的地區，並在2020年前後快速擴張。隨著片商「麻豆傳媒」停運，外界開始質疑這波繁榮是否與中國市場及博弈資金有關。</summary></entry><entry><title>新鴨綠江大橋閒置12年終開通：中朝關係回暖？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:33:54Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T12:46:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad--fac779159e2d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">連接中國與朝鮮的鴨綠江大橋，在閒置12年之後終於正式開通。近年朝鮮與俄羅斯關係愈走愈近，專家分析中方需要透過開通大橋鞏固對朝關係，也被視為關係回暖的象徵。</summary></entry><entry><title>薄熙來前搭檔受查：重慶政壇「不倒翁」黃奇帆是誰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T14:46:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad--7b329579f173.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中共中紀委宣佈，已退出政壇多年的前重慶市長黃奇帆涉嫌「嚴重違紀違法」，正接受調查。此消息正值中共五中全會前夕，引發外界關注。</summary></entry><entry><title>賴清德雙十講話：台灣強化防衛不是放棄對話</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c58jz8w7kmjyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T05:01:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c58jz8w7kmjyo/trad--c3d85a63fdbb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c58jz8w7kmjyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣舉行2026年雙十國慶大會，總統賴清德講話引用基督教《聖經》提出要建設「山巔之城」，讓台灣成為「維護印太和平與穩定的關鍵力量」。</summary></entry><entry><title>「工程師治國」：中國為何熱衷於「超級工程」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T03:16:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad--389d07ba0142.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">大型建設工程正在重塑中國——從巨型大壩、龐大的太陽能發電場，到覆蓋全國的高鐵網絡。北京的「工程師思維」能否助其應對氣候變化？</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普排除美中合作開發人工智能</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T04:39:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad--fb69b70800e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統繼續拒絕為人工智慧設立監管措施的呼籲，認為這將扼殺人工智慧的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普習近平峰會：沒有說出口的議題可能更重要</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T03:48:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad--249695977d55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白宮峰會最耐人尋味之處，或許在於中美兩國領導人沒有說哪些事，以及我們至今仍不知道哪些事。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉是甚麼？這是一份簡易指南</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T04:41:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad--30e500462b02.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq5ynx00d4leo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國選民將於11月3日前往投票，這場選舉的結果可能對唐納德·特朗普（川普）的總統任期產生重大影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>伊朗與烏克蘭 哪場戰爭對柴油價格影響最大？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9p8gv3dnjmgo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T00:12:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9p8gv3dnjmgo/trad--aa79994e2844.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9p8gv3dnjmgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">兩場衝突都導致柴油出口減少，但數據顯示，中東地區減少的供應量更多。</summary></entry><entry><title>廣州開發電玩遊戲「喚醒」威爾士民間傳說潛力</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm20wlw680w9o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T00:12:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm20wlw680w9o/trad--24a35273f767.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm20wlw680w9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">開發商廣州深藍互動表示，威爾斯神話與該遊戲的主題產生了強烈共鳴。</summary></entry><entry><title>「黑珍珠」瑪麗亞：表演中國川劇的塞拉利昂女子</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg47k6z44w7o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T00:17:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg47k6z44w7o/trad--57835275c3d9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg47k6z44w7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">瑪麗亞夢想成為一名歌手和表演者。多年後，她前往中國參加一場選美比賽，並在火車上獲一名陌生人意外伸出援手後，最終在那裏建立了自己的生活。</summary></entry><entry><title>胡塞武裝空襲對華重要窗口利雅德機場 中東衝突又一危險時刻</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqy0rd16x33lo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T11:06:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqy0rd16x33lo/trad--5e18fa44bef6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqy0rd16x33lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">胡塞武裝加強了對沙特阿拉伯領土的攻擊，儘管實體損害能夠迅速修復，但其穩定聲譽正遭受重創。</summary></entry><entry><title>華為尊界V800事件：一場煞車測試如何演變成中國輿論風暴</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c862yzkgzwero/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T09:04:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c862yzkgzwero/trad--47059d36e1c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c862yzkgzwero/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近期，中國知名車媒懂車帝發布對尊界V800的實測影片，顯示多輛測試車在緊急制動過程中出現制動踏板支架斷裂，事件迅速引發輿論關注。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國民兵船「首現台灣東部海域」意味著什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmeweg5eg7ljo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T05:31:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmeweg5eg7ljo/trad--89d511d9a7e5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmeweg5eg7ljo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一艘被辨識為中國海上民兵船的漁船，8月在台灣東部外海與另外兩艘中國船隻共同活動。軍事學者向BBC中文分析，這類船隻可能有海上監控、情報蒐集等任務。</summary></entry><entry><title>種族歧視風波爆發時，與Lisa共處一室是什麼感受？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw30empz9qyvo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T06:44:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw30empz9qyvo/trad--2d8980ad9c35.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw30empz9qyvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">紀錄片導演蘇·金談到，她如何以前所未有的近距離接觸K-pop偶像Lisa，見證其最坦率真實的一面。</summary></entry><entry><title>台北選戰掀美沙冬爭議　香港逾半世紀戒毒經驗有何啟示？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n8dx52dgj5o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T01:12:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n8dx52dgj5o/trad--c4d486347e33.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n8dx52dgj5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美沙冬戒毒治療成為台北地方選舉議題，討論熱烈，香港早於半世紀前已開展門診計劃，BBC中文梳理其發展歷史，剖析社會迷思。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T04:47:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>人類身高的起伏變化：哪些歷史事件影響最大？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T17:26:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad--d25b147665fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如今我們的身高比100年前高了大約10厘米，但這並非一帆風順。</summary></entry><entry><title>什麼是「微笑抑鬱」？如何察覺徵兆？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c53981jp28e0o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T00:41:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c53981jp28e0o/trad--9fcc094e0ba0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c53981jp28e0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如果你表面上看起來很快樂，內心卻飽受煎熬，你可能患有非典型抑鬱症。然而，隱藏真實感受可能對心理健康造成傷害。</summary></entry><entry><title>這位丈夫15年來潛水760次，就為了「靠近」海嘯失蹤的妻子</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60rlq5d24wwo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T07:48:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60rlq5d24wwo/trad--308fd03443f1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c60rlq5d24wwo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">2011年日本海嘯期間，高松康雄的妻子祐子被巨浪捲走，遺體至今仍未尋獲。兩年後，他開始學習潛水，此後一直堅持每月兩次潛入大海，以這種方式懷念妻子，延續對她的愛，並感受與她之間的聯繫。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄羅斯鼠疫會引發一場全球疫情嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyq35pnxjno/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T12:34:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyq35pnxjno/trad--8286e8e3f4d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyq35pnxjno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">與新冠病毒不同，肺鼠疫要等到症狀出現後才能傳播，通常在24小時內。症狀嚴重且明顯，因此後續個案可在傳播發生前被迅速辨識、隔離並治療。</summary></entry><entry><title>「地球不只有一個北極」——怎麼講？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69wzrwr2z1eo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T02:16:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69wzrwr2z1eo/trad--be6d5bef8044.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69wzrwr2z1eo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">北極有不止一種定義，有些甚至不是固定不動的。</summary></entry></feed>
